{"translation":{"id":"fra_jnd","name":"Bible J.N. Darby","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=frajnd","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=frajnd","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"JND","englishName":"French: Bible J.N. Darby","language":"fra","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"121a3f4841e42965f22ebebcf5a8578a12578ec30eaf1ca7ae4e46d5d85ccb80","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/fra_jnd/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31170,"languageName":"français","languageEnglishName":"French"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"fra_jnd","name":"Les Psaumes","commonName":"Les Psaumes","title":"Les Psaumes","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"4c48a766d24644f7ef347ae1395ef8ddb5d363cc30acf1733162d22f071b120e","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/fra_jnd/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/fra_jnd/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2527},"chapter":{"number":23,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"Psaume de David. L’Éternel est mon berger : je ne manquerai de rien.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Il me fait reposer dans de verts pâturages, il me mène à des eaux paisibles.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Il restaure mon âme ; il me conduit dans des sentiers de justice, à cause de son nom.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Même quand je marcherais par la vallée de l’ombre de la mort, je ne craindrai aucun mal ; car tu es avec moi : ta houlette et ton bâton, ce sont eux qui me consolent.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Tu dresses devant moi une table, en la présence de mes ennemis ; tu as oint ma tête d’huile, ma coupe est comble.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Oui, la bonté et la gratuité me suivront tous les jours de ma vie, et mon habitation sera dans la maison de l’Éternel pour de longs jours.","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/fra_jnd/PSA/23.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/fra_jnd/PSA/24.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/fra_jnd/PSA/22.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":6}